{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/6c60076f9596ebb847544a01b265f654.poster.avif?t=1763502033\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/6c60076f9596ebb847544a01b265f654.webm?t=1763502033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/6c60076f9596ebb847544a01b265f654.mp4?t=1763502033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE JOB IS SIMPLE: HUNT THE CORRUPTION. KEEP THE TREASURE.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a mercenary hired by a shadowy group to cleanse the 12 corrupted zones of Ember Island. This forgotten land is bursting with loot, and the rules are clear: <strong>every gem and gold coin you acquire is yours to keep.</strong> But the path to riches requires mastery, grit, and the willingness to risk everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.poster.avif?t=1763502033\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.webm?t=1763502033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/8feb60715dc56a0a21eca05eb6fb8cb1.mp4?t=1763502033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>### ARCADE ACTION. NO SAVES.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the demanding difficulty of 8-bit classics. <strong>Ember Island</strong> challenges you to conquer all 12 unique levels, from the Outer Forest to the final Sanctuary, in a <strong>single, unforgiving playthrough.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single Run Rule:</strong> Choose your hero (Knight, Mage, or Rogue) at the start; there is no swapping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Difficulty:</strong> Unlimited continues let you keep trying, but running out of lives means returning to the start of the current level with a score reset.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beat the Clock:</strong> Each level is governed by a <strong>3-minute timer</strong>, pushing you to maintain high-octane forward momentum.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.poster.avif?t=1763502033\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.webm?t=1763502033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.mp4?t=1763502033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Champion: Three Distinct Playstyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure into the island with one of three distinct classes, each offering a unique approach to survival and combat:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f The Knight: Balanced Vanguard</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Safest Start:</strong> Trade <strong>Low Speed</strong> for exceptional <strong>Survivability (Health 4)</strong>, using your high health pool to push through early challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Feature:</strong> The <strong>Fireball</strong> secondary attack provides a crucial, safe ranged option.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus:</strong> Tanking, defense, and reliability.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 The Mage: Tactical Zoner</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Glass Cannon:</strong> Relies on a vast <strong>Mana Pool (4)</strong> and calculated movement to manage distance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Feature:</strong> Use the <strong>Range 3</strong> primary attack for consistent zoning and perpetually locking down enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus:</strong> Precision, crowd control, and tactical positioning.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f The Rogue: The Berserker</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Risk, High-Reward:</strong> The <strong>Fastest Class</strong> in the game, designed for aggressive, close-quarters combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Feature:</strong> Use your unmatched speed to bypass threats and unleash devastating, Mana-fueled burst damage via the <strong>Whirlwind Slash</strong> (3 Damage).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus:</strong> Speed, burst damage, and bypassing encounters.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>### BOSSES AND BOUNTIES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a varied gauntlet of 12 zones, each with unique enemies and traps, culminating in an epic boss battle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps &amp; Hazards:</strong> Navigate dripping lava, swinging spikes, and collapsible floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Scale:</strong> Battle through the lush <strong>Outer Forest</strong>, precision platforming of <strong>Poison Cliffs</strong>, and the final, treacherous <strong>Sanctuary</strong> to confront the source of the corruption head-on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies:</strong>\u00a0Over 30 unique enemy types</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976950?t=1763502033","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/d7792f68696c5ec31a302dd5c9751b95f996d96f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763502033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/52798da309da4bab5087e098665be84bb76eeb22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763502033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/52798da309da4bab5087e098665be84bb76eeb22/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763502033","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4026380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/6c60076f9596ebb847544a01b265f654.poster.avif?t=1763502033\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/6c60076f9596ebb847544a01b265f654.webm?t=1763502033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/6c60076f9596ebb847544a01b265f654.mp4?t=1763502033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=