ctane forward momentum.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.poster.avif?t=1763502033\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.webm?t=1763502033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/extras/a265e25626b87a3280a752d81db045ef.mp4?t=1763502033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Champion: Three Distinct Playstyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure into the island with one of three distinct classes, each offering a unique approach to survival and combat:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f The Knight: Balanced Vanguard</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Safest Start:</strong> Trade <strong>Low Speed</strong> for exceptional <strong>Survivability (Health 4)</strong>, using your high health pool to push through early challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Feature:</strong> The <strong>Fireball</strong> secondary attack provides a crucial, safe ranged option.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus:</strong> Tanking, defense, and reliability.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 The Mage: Tactical Zoner</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Glass Cannon:</strong> Relies on a vast <strong>Mana Pool (4)</strong> and calculated movement to manage distance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Feature:</strong> Use the <strong>Range 3</strong> primary attack for consistent zoning and perpetually locking down enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus:</strong> Precision, crowd control, and tactical positioning.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udde1\ufe0f The Rogue: The Berserker</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Risk, High-Reward:</strong> The <strong>Fastest Class</strong> in the game, designed for aggressive, close-quarters combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Feature:</strong> Use your unmatched speed to bypass threats and unleash devastating, Mana-fueled burst damage via the <strong>Whirlwind Slash</strong> (3 Damage).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus:</strong> Speed, burst damage, and bypassing encounters.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>### BOSSES AND BOUNTIES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a varied gauntlet of 12 zones, each with unique enemies and traps, culminating in an epic boss battle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traps &amp; Hazards:</strong> Navigate dripping lava, swinging spikes, and collapsible floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Scale:</strong> Battle through the lush <strong>Outer Forest</strong>, precision platforming of <strong>Poison Cliffs</strong>, and the final, treacherous <strong>Sanctuary</strong> to confront the source of the corruption head-on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies:</strong>\u00a0Over 30 unique enemy types</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Calibus Creations LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976950/062e14b61cb20f21ff6c87a90cf496b507caba60/header.jpg?t=1763502033","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requir